#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add ancillas for wire cuts and expand the observables to account for ancilla"
" qubits {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-"
"for-ancilla-qubits}"
msgstr ""
"와이어 커팅을 위한 ancilla를 추가하고 ancilla 큐비트를 고려하여 관측량을 확장합니다 {#add-ancillas-for-"
"wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-for-ancilla-qubits}"

